sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Deployer (EOA)
  participant W as CampaignWrapper
  participant F as TokenFactory
  participant PM as PositionManager
  participant H as TokenLaunchHook
  D->>W: launchCampaign(params)
  opt fresh token
    W->>F: deploy ERC-20
  end
  W->>PM: multicall([initializePool, mint])
  PM->>H: beforeAddLiquidity (first mint)
  Note over H: bootstrap — capture gov NFT<br/>(salt == tokenId), arm mechanisms
  PM-->>D: LP position = governance NFT
  Note over W,H: one atomic tx · one shared hook (mined CREATE2) · once per chain
